\">Le Goose.</a></span>\n</p>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<p class=\"mw-empty-elt\">\n</p><aside role=\"region\" class=\"portable-infobox pi-background pi-border-color pi-theme-wikia pi-layout-default\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-item-spacing pi-title pi-secondary-background\" data-source=\"title\">Big stupid things.</h2>\n\n<figure class=\"pi-item pi-image\">\n\t<a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/task/images/9/90/Big_stupid_things..png/revision/latest?cb=20240916233711\" class=\"image image-thumbnail\" title=\"Big stupid things.\">\n\t\t<img src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/task/images/9/90/Big_stupid_things..png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/268?cb=20240916233711\" srcset=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/task/images/9/90/Big_stupid_things..png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/268?cb=20240916233711 1x, https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/task/images/9/90/Big_stupid_things..png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/536?cb=20240916233711 2x\" class=\"pi-image-thumbnail\" data-relevant=\"1\" alt=\"Big stupid things.\" width=\"270\" height=\"152\" data-image-key=\"Big_stupid_things..png\" data-image-name=\"Big stupid things..png\" />\n\t\t\n\t</a>\n\t\n</figure>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"series\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Series</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><a href=\"/wiki/Series_18\" title=\"Series 18\">18</a></div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"episode\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Episode</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">5</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"winner\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Winner</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><a href=\"/wiki/Emma_Sidi\" title=\"Emma Sidi\">Emma Sidi</a></div>\n</div>\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Episode Guide</h2>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n\t<table class=\"pi-horizontal-group\">\n\t\n\t\n\t<thead>\n\t\t<tr>\n\t\t\n\t\t\t<th class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-label pi-secondary-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"previous\">← Previous</th>\n\t\t\n\t\t\t<th class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-label pi-secondary-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"next\">Next →</th>\n\t\t\n\t\t</tr>\n\t</thead>\n\t\n\t<tbody>\n\t<tr>\n\t\n\t\t<td class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-value pi-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"previous\"><a href=\"/wiki/I%27m_a_girl_who_likes_a_clean_line.\" title=\"I&#39;m a girl who likes a clean line.\">I'm a girl who likes a clean line.</a></td>\n\t\n\t\t<td class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-value pi-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"next\"><a href=\"/wiki/A_dance_as_old_as_time_itself.\" title=\"A dance as old as time itself.\">A dance as old as time itself.</a></td>\n\t\n\t</tr>\n\t</tbody>\n</table>\n\n</section>\n</aside>\n\n<p class=\"mw-empty-elt\"></p><p><i><b>Big stupid things.</b></i> is the fifth episode of <a href=\"/wiki/Series_18\" title=\"Series 18\">Series 18</a> of <i><a href=\"/wiki/Taskmaster\" title=\"Taskmaster\">Taskmaster</a></i> and was broadcast on <a href=\"/wiki/Channel_4\" title=\"Channel 4\">Channel 4</a> on 10 October 2024. The episode was won by <a href=\"/wiki/Emma_Sidi\" title=\"Emma Sidi\">Emma Sidi</a>.\n</p>\n<div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Episode_title\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Episode title</span></a>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Alternate_titles\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1.1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Alternate titles</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Episode_breakdown\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Episode breakdown</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#Trivia\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Trivia</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-5\"><a href=\"#External_links\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">External links</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Episode_title\">Episode title</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Edit section: Episode title\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"edit-section-anon\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://taskmaster.fandom.com/wiki/Big_stupid_things.?veaction=edit&amp;section=1\" aria-label=\"Edit section: Episode title\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><a href=\"/wiki/Emma_Sidi\" title=\"Emma Sidi\">Emma Sidi</a> states that she just loves \"Big stupid things\", during studio discussion of her reaction to seeing <a href=\"/wiki/Alex_Horne\" title=\"Alex Horne\">Alex Horne</a> dressed as a robot for the <a href=\"/wiki/Direct_the_robot_to_its_charging_station\" title=\"Direct the robot to its charging station\">Direct the robot to its charging station</a> task. The title card shows the robot from the aforementioned task in the reflection of a TV screen. The TV is likely a reference to the <a href=\"/wiki/Present_the_most_heart-warming_final_story_for_a_local_news_programme\" title=\"Present the most heart-warming final story for a local news programme\">Present the most heart-warming final story for a local news programme</a> task.\n</p>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Alternate_titles\">Alternate titles</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Edit section: Alternate titles\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"edit-section-anon\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://taskmaster.fandom.com/wiki/Big_stupid_things.?veaction=edit&amp;section=2\" aria-label=\"Edit section: Alternate titles\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h3>\n<ul><li>On Finland's MTV Katsomo streaming platform, this episode is titled 'Isoja, typeriä juttuja', which translates as 'Big, stupid things'.</li>\n<li>On Norway's Discovery+ Norge streaming platform, this episode is titled 'Store, dumme ting', which translates as 'Big, stupid things'.<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div></li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Episode_breakdown\">Episode breakdown</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Edit section: Episode breakdown\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"edit-section-anon\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://taskmaster.fandom.com/wiki/Big_stupid_things.?veaction=edit&amp;section=3\" aria-label=\"Edit section: Episode breakdown\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<div class=\"mbox\"><div class=\"mbox&#95;&#95;content\"><div class=\"mbox&#95;&#95;content&#95;&#95;wrapper\"><div class=\"mbox&#95;&#95;content&#95;&#95;header\">Spoilers!</div><div class=\"mbox&#95;&#95;content&#95;&#95;text mw-collapsible\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-spoilers\">This section contains spoilers.</div><span class=\"mbox&#95;&#95;close mw-customtoggle-spoilers\" title=\"Dismiss\"></span></div></div></div>\n<table class=\"tmtable\">\n\n<tbody><tr class=\"tmtableheader\">\n<th>Task\n</th>\n<th>Description\n</th>\n<th><a href=\"/wiki/Andy_Zaltzman\" title=\"Andy Zaltzman\"><span style=\"color:#FFF;\">Andy Zaltzman</span></a>\n</th>\n<th><a href=\"/wiki/Bab%C3%A1t%C3%BAnd%C3%A9_Al%C3%A9sh%C3%A9\" title=\"Babátúndé Aléshé\"><span style=\"color:#FFF;\">Babátúndé Aléshé</span></a>\n</th>\n<th><a href=\"/wiki/Emma_Sidi\" title=\"Emma Sidi\"><span style=\"color:#FFF;\">Emma Sidi</span></a>\n</th>\n<th><a href=\"/wiki/Jack_Dee\" title=\"Jack Dee\"><span style=\"color:#FFF;\">Jack Dee</span></a>\n</th>\n<th><a href=\"/wiki/Rosie_Jones\" title=\"Rosie Jones\"><span style=\"color:#FFF;\">Rosie Jones</span></a>\n</th></tr>\n<tr class=\"tmtablerow\">\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/The_thing_that_is_best_when_you_add_liquid_to_it\" title=\"The thing that is best when you add liquid to it\">1</a>\n</td>\n<td><b>Prize:</b> The thing that is best when you add liquid to it.\n</td>\n<td>4\n</td>\n<td>1\n</td>\n<td><b>5</b>\n</td>\n<td>3\n</td>\n<td>2\n</td></tr>\n<tr class=\"tmtablerow\">\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/Direct_the_robot_to_its_charging_station\" title=\"Direct the robot to its charging station\">2</a>\n</td>\n<td>Direct the robot to its charging station and plug it in. You must give the robot an instruction every 10 seconds. The robot will ignore any instructions that contain the letter O or E. You may not touch the robot.\n</td>\n<td>1\n</td>\n<td>4\n</td>\n<td><b>5</b>\n</td>\n<td>3\n</td>\n<td>2\n</td></tr>\n<tr class=\"tmtablerow\">\n<td rowspan=\"2\"><a href=\"/wiki/Make_the_strongest_smell\" title=\"Make the strongest smell\">3</a>\n</td>\n<td>Make the strongest smell. You must seal your smell in this jar and the Taskmaster will open it in the studio.\n</td>\n<td rowspan=\"2\">3\n</td>\n<td rowspan=\"2\">4\n</td>\n<td rowspan=\"2\">2\n</td>\n<td rowspan=\"2\"><b>5</b>\n</td>\n<td rowspan=\"2\">1\n</td></tr>\n<tr class=\"tmtablerow\">\n<td>You must smell your smell in the studio before the Taskmaster smells your smell. If you refuse to smell your smell, the Taskmaster will not smell your smell and you will receive zero points.\n</td></tr>\n<tr class=\"tmtablerow\">\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/Present_the_most_heart-warming_final_story_for_a_local_news_programme\" title=\"Present the most heart-warming final story for a local news programme\">4</a>\n</td>\n<td><b>Team:</b> Present the most heart-warming final story for a local news programme.\n</td>\n<td><b>4</b>\n</td>\n<td><b>4</b>\n</td>\n<td><b>4</b>\n</td>\n<td>3\n</td>\n<td>3\n</td></tr>\n<tr class=\"tmtablerow\">\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/Land_your_skydiver_closest_to_the_seal\" title=\"Land your skydiver closest to the seal\">5</a>\n</td>\n<td><b>Live:</b> Land your skydiver closest to the seal. You must catapult your skydiver with the catapult. Furthest from the target each round is eliminated.\n</td>\n<td>1\n</td>\n<td>2\n</td>\n<td>3\n</td>\n<td><b>5</b>\n</td>\n<td>4\n</td></tr>\n<tr class=\"tmtablerow\">\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/Work_out_how_many_days_old_Alex_will_be_on_Christmas_Day_2024\" title=\"Work out how many days old Alex will be on Christmas Day 2024\">T</a>\n</td>\n<td>Work out how many days old Alex will be on Christmas Day 2024. You must make eye contact with Alex the whole time and can only give one answer.\n</td>\n<td>-\n</td>\n<td>-\n</td>\n<td><b>✔</b>\n</td>\n<td>✘\n</td>\n<td>-\n</td></tr>\n<tr class=\"tmtabletotal\">\n<th colspan=\"2\">Total\n</th>\n<td>13\n</td>\n<td>15\n</td>\n<td class=\"tmtablewinner\">19\n</td>\n<td>19\n</td>\n<td>12\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Trivia\">Trivia</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Edit section: Trivia\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"edit-section-anon\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://taskmaster.fandom.com/wiki/Big_stupid_things.?veaction=edit&amp;section=4\" aria-label=\"Edit section: Trivia\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ul><li>For the studio segments of the episode, Zaltzman wore a snooker player outfit. This was one of his four studio outfits that lead up to his outfit for <a href=\"/wiki/Le_Goose.\" title=\"Le Goose.\">the final episode</a>. This snooker outfit had had the Mandarin words '任务师父' printed on a tag, which directly translates to Taskmaster. (任务 is task, and 师父 is master; there is no specialised term.)</li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"External_links\">External links</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Edit section: External links\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"edit-section-anon\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://taskmaster.fandom.com/wiki/Big_stupid_things.?veaction=edit&amp;section=5\" aria-label=\"Edit section: External links\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ul><li><a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer noopener\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://www.channel4.com/programmes/taskmaster/\"><i>Big stupid things.</i> on All 4</a></li></ul>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260920141530\nCache expiry: 2592000\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [show‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.088 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.128 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 942/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 26168/2097152 bytes\